1070/extras/6dd8b41d99ffb7e8ffb1f1603d7fc728.webm?t=1752671795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111070/extras/6dd8b41d99ffb7e8ffb1f1603d7fc728.mp4?t=1752671795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No-Combat &amp; Sneak:\u00a0</strong>Navigate around the danger without ever drawing a weapon, relying instead on your wits, stealth, and timing. Outsmart ancient traps, environmental hazards, and dangerous monsters that challenge your intellect, while slipping silently past threats through shadowy corridors. Master the art of evasion and stay undetected as you explore the ancient ruins, ensuring your journey remains uninterrupted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111070/extras/10781657a2d5bf32c994fedc13e3a0c1.poster.avif?t=1752671795\" width=650 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111070/extras/10781657a2d5bf32c994fedc13e3a0c1.webm?t=1752671795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111070/extras/10781657a2d5bf32c994fedc13e3a0c1.mp4?t=1752671795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Using Items to Your Advantage:\u00a0</strong>Harness a variety of unique gadgets and mystical potions to bypass obstacles. Experiment by combining items to disarm traps, reveal hidden inscriptions, or get past enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><strong> Are you ready to delve into the depths and reclaim the forgotten legacy of the dwarves?</strong></h2>",
